mkdir C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Windows\DllHost\
move /Y dllhost.exe C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\Windows\DllHost\dllhost.exe   The second command then moves the proxy tool (dllhost.exe) into that newly created directory.

