S3Q19


It looks like the employee (Haley) downloaded the .docx file from the internet. What was the full url that she downloaded it from?

from the previous question we know this file Renewable_Energy_Investment.docx jhas bin created
C:\Users\dahaley\Downloads\Renewable_Energy_Investment.docx

let A=
Employees
|where username contains "dahaley"
| project ip_addr;
OutboundNetworkEvents
| where src_ip has_any (A)
| where url contains "Renewable_Energy_Investment.docx"


