S3Q24

How many people were targeted within that "wave" of emails?

Email
| where subject contains "[EXTERNAL] FW: Critical: Energy Supply Chain Disruption Alert"
| distinct recipient
//17

S3Q25

How many total emails did the actor send with that subject?

Email
| where subject contains "[EXTERNAL] FW: Critical: Energy Supply Chain Disruption Alert"
|count //17

S3Q26

You noticed there was a secondary email address in the email. 🧐

What is this email address?

check reply_to

Email
| where subject contains "[EXTERNAL] FW: Critical: Energy Supply Chain Disruption Alert"

