S3Q27

How many unique employees did the threat actors phish using this new sender email address?

Email
| where reply_to contains "org@yandex.com" or sender contains "org@yandex.com"
| distinct recipient //115


S3Q28

How many unique employees received emails containing domains used in links sent by the previous sender?

pivoting on email

let A=
Email
| where reply_to contains "org@yandex.com" or sender contains "org@yandex.com"
| parse link with "://" domain "/" * 
| distinct domain;
Email
| where link  has_any (A)
| distinct recipient

