S3Q30

What was the least used domain among that batch of emails (from question 28)?

let A=
Email
| where reply_to contains "org@yandex.com" or sender contains "org@yandex.com"
| parse link with "://" domain "/" * 
| distinct domain;
Email
| where link  has_any (A)
| summarize EmailCount = count() by link
| order by EmailCount asc


